Z||000002||Bozone||06-23-99||11:29 AM||||Cliff - Hope you don't mind this "ad" for the newsgroup - and I hope you join in too. Oddly enough one of our first posts was in Dutch, so we referred him to you.<br>Actually it's alt.autos.fiero (with an "s" in autos) and its' accessed through a newsreader or the newgroups sections of IE or Netscape Communicator or Navigators 2 & 3. It's brandy new, started last week. Come and join in. Not trying to get you to migrate from Cliff's - it's just another forum we can gab in about our Fieros. Once you're on, it's easy and not moderated so if there's an occasional tangential thread, well, we'll see how it goes. <br>Note to Gokart: It's not a website (www). There are three major divisions on the internet: websites like this one, email/mail lists like the fiero.org list, and newsgroups. This is the only newsgroup - the other is for ALL Pontiacs. You subscribe to it through the news browser and you can't be kicked off. 
Z||000003||Cliff Pennock||06-23-99||01:24 PM||||I don't mind at all. I'm not selling something here, I'm providing something for Fiero owners and to be honest, the more places a Fiero owner can go to, the better. For people having difficulties reaching the newsgroup, click here:  <A HREF="news:///alt.autos.fiero" TARGET=_blank>news:///alt.autos.fiero</A> 
