Z||000007||Bozone||06-24-99||01:32 PM||||Cliff-I didn't know you could set it up that way (news:///etc) It works on this machine. When I hit the road and use my laptop next week, maybe that will be my salvation. Thanks.<p>Anyone having a problem getting to the NG, you might have to ask your provider to put it on their news-server. We're working on getting AOL right now. Some of the other might not do it unless asked. You'ld be surprised at the number of people who don't know what it is or think it's not popular. Guess we're an odd bunch but we like it that way. Yup! Yup! Yup! Yup! Yup! Yup! 
